===============================================================================

 PURPOSE:
 ~~~~~~~~
  - Are You Getting Tired Changing 1 Bulletin and then Copying it to all
    other Conferences, then This is the Tool for You!!
    All Bulletins are now stored in 1 Directory so only one Bulletin
    has to change to 'Show' it in all conferences.

  - This DOOR is a Alternative to the 'b' command in /X 3.xx


===============================================================================

 REQUIREMENTS:
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  /X 3.xx
  It Won't work with Ami Express 1.1x & 2.xx!!


===============================================================================

 INSTALLATION:
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  - Copy the EmP_Tools Directory to DOORS:
  - Edit DOORS:EmP_Tools/Bulls.CFG to your Needs.

--start: cut here------------------------------------------------------------
DUAL_LISTING       YES                 ; Use 2 Listings [YES/NO]                   
CURSOR_KEYS        YES                 ; Use Cursors to select a Bull [YES/NO]
[Init_END]====================================================================
System Setup                                       ; bull1.txt
Te Koop / For Sale                                 ; bull2.txt
-                                                  ; bull3.txt Doesn't Exist
GameBoy & Nintendo Cards                           ; bull4.txt
LastCallers & TopUps                               ; bull5.txt
-                                                  ; bull6.txt Doesn't Exist
-                                                  ; bull7.txt Doesn't Exist
HST ASL & DS ASL Settings                          ; bull8.txt
BBS Legal Disclaimer                               ; bull9.txt
Private Bull #1                                    ; bull10.txt
Private Bull #2                                    ; bull11.txt
Private Bull #3                                    ; bull12.txt
Private Bull #4                                    ; bull13.txt
Private Bull #5                                    ; bull14.txt
Private Bull #6                                    ; bull15.txt
Private Bull #7                                    ; bull16.txt
Private Bull #8                                    ; bull17.txt
Private Bull #9                                    ; bull18.txt
Private Bull #10                                   ; bull19.txt
[BullNames_END]===============================================================
XX------X----------                                ; Conference 1
XX-X---XX----------                                ; Conference 2
XX-XX--XX----------                                ; Conference 3
XX-X---XX----------                                ; Conference 4
XX-X---XX----------                                ; Conference 5
XX-X---XX----------                                ; Conference 6
XX-X---XX----------                                ; Conference 7
XX------X----------                                ; Conference 8
XX-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX                                ; Conference 9
XX-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX                                ; Conference 10
[CnfAccess_END]===============================================================
