   \______\/\_____\/\_____\/\_____\/\_____\/  \_\/   \__\/\_____\/\_____\/
[34m  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

[Title_END]===================================================================
--end: cut here--------------------------------------------------------------

  - Init:
    ~~~~~
     Change to 'Y' if you want 2 Output Lists otherwise change to 'N'.

    BullNames
    ~~~~~~~~~
     These Are the Bulletin Names.
     (1 List: Max 39 Chars, 2 Lists: Max 31 Chars)

    CnfAccess:
    ~~~~~~~~~~
     Here you can Select which Bulletins can be Read in which Conference
     for example:

      Conference 1 is XX------X---------- then the following bulls are shown.

                [1]  System Setup
                [2]  For Sale
                [9]  BBS Legal Disclaimer


      Conference 4 is XX-X---XX---------- then the following bulls are shown.

                [1]  System Setup
                [2]  For Sale
                [4]  GameBoy & Nintendo Cards
                [8]  HST ASL & DS ASL Settings
                [9]  BBS Legal Disclaimer

    Title:
    ~~~~~~
     Bulletin Logo.
     Keep in mind:  Max 20 Lines and 200 Chars/Line!
     In Bulls.TXT are a few Logo Examples to choose from.


  - If you have Fewer (or More) Conferences than the 10 above then you
    can Leave them out (or put them in!).

  - Create a Directory:  BBS:Bulletins
    And copy all your Bulletins (from a Conference) to it.


  AE 3.xx:
  ~~~~~~~~
  - Copy B.info to BBS:Commands/BBScmd/

    Or add to B.info ICON ToolType Info:

      ACCESS=001
      LOCATION=DOORS:EmP_Tools/Bulls
      MULTINODE=YES
      PRIORITY=0
      STACK=50000
      TYPE=XIM


  - Don't forget to Redirect Output Files from Others tools (in logOff.bat)
    to BBS:bulletins and Not to the 'old' BBS:Conference/Bulletins! 


===============================================================================

 USAGE:
 ~~~~~~
  Just enter B on the MAIN screen in AmiExpress.


===============================================================================

 ERROR MESSAGES:
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

  o ERROR:  Bulls 2.0 ONLY Works with /X 3.xx!!
  `-------> Obvious

  o ERROR:  BBS:Bulletins/bull{x}.txt Not Found !!
  `-------> Bulletin {x} can't be found in BBS:Bulletins

  o ERROR:  DOORS:EmP_Tools/Bulls.CFG Not Found !!
  `-------> Bulls.CFG can't be found in DOORS:EmP_Tools

  o ERROR:  UnKnown Keyword: XXXXXXXX in JoinCnf.CFG
  |
  `--> There must be 2 different KeyWords in the INIT part (Bulls.CFG)
       Compare this with the original Bulls.CFG
       Check that the KeyWords are:

         DUAL_LISTINGS
         CURSOR_KEYS


