 NOTE:
 ~~~~~
  o This Program Has been tested on a /X 2.0 - 3.38 Configuration.

  o If a User uses More lines then the sysop can see the Screen-Output on
    the Sysop-side will be scrambled caused by the Ansi-Handling but on
    the Users-side it will be ok!!


